                {
                  "_type": "UMLTextView",
                  "_id": "c2-uml-00577",
                  "font": "Microsoft YaHei;13;0",
                  "lineColor": "#30435b",
                  "fontColor": "#30435b",
                  "left": 90,
                  "top": 1185,
                  "width": 3070,
                  "height": 115,
                  "text": "权限拒绝：AuthorizationService 抛出异常，由 BusinessRequestAudit.record 捕获并记录 REJECTED；状态错误同样回滚。\n成功：record 注册 afterCompletion；Spring 提交事务后才记录 COMMITTED。func 通过 JPA 脏检查保存，OO 显式调用仓储端口保存。\nController 返回 200 ApprovalResultVO；自审核允许。CloneFactory 仍由 Maven 注解处理器生成映射。",
                  "wordWrap": true,
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "c2-uml-00513"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "showSequenceNumber": true,
              "sequenceNumbering": "custom",
              "showActivation": true,
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c2-uml-00512"
              }
            }
          ],
