              "left": 80,
              "top": 590,
              "width": 1250,
              "height": 48,
              "text": "递归多对多联系：一对有向角色端仅存一条边；双方同归属（含双方共享）。",
              "wordWrap": true,
              "horzAlign": 2,
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c2-uml-01353"
              }
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLTextView",
              "_id": "c2-uml-01378",
              "font": "Microsoft YaHei;16;0",
              "lineColor": "#30435b",
              "fontColor": "#30435b",
              "left": 80,
              "top": 645,
              "width": 1250,
              "height": 48,
              "text": "高级角色沿 senior → junior 获取权限；禁止自身与传递环路。闭包不落为额外继承边。",
              "wordWrap": true,
              "horzAlign": 2,
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c2-uml-01353"
              }
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLTextView",
              "_id": "c2-uml-01379",
              "font": "Microsoft YaHei;16;0",
              "lineColor": "#30435b",
              "fontColor": "#30435b",
              "left": 80,
              "top": 700,
              "width": 1250,
              "height": 48,
              "text": "矩形=实体；菱形=联系；椭圆=属性；下划线=主标识。范围约束由应用层检查。",
              "wordWrap": true,
              "horzAlign": 2,
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c2-uml-01353"
              }
            }
