                  "left": 597.0,
                  "top": 1403,
                  "width": 780,
                  "height": 54,
                  "text": "校验失败抛出原业务异常并回滚；成功执行 CloneFactory 映射并注册提交后审计。",
                  "wordWrap": true,
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "c2-uml-02198"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLTextView",
                  "_id": "c2-uml-02257",
                  "font": "Microsoft YaHei;13;0",
                  "lineColor": "#30435b",
                  "fontColor": "#30435b",
                  "left": 90,
                  "top": 1648,
                  "width": 2094,
                  "height": 115,
                  "text": "update/withdraw/delete 要求本人；update/withdraw 仅 PENDING，delete 仅 REJECTED。reject 不要求本人且允许自审核；撤回不能重提。\n本图省略统一 Audit.record 的回调跳转、OO 适配器内部映射和 Controller 响应，详见核心审批图与事务审计图。",
                  "wordWrap": true,
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "c2-uml-02198"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "showSequenceNumber": true,
              "sequenceNumbering": "custom",
              "showActivation": true,
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c2-uml-02197"
              }
            }
          ],
