                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLTextView",
                  "_id": "c2-uml-02586",
                  "font": "Microsoft YaHei;13;0",
                  "lineColor": "#30435b",
                  "fontColor": "#30435b",
                  "left": 90,
                  "top": 2208,
                  "width": 1862,
                  "height": 115,
                  "text": "BackendHTTP表示Security过滤链与AuthController的整体协议边界，不表示Controller直接操作Redis。登录内部：accounts.verify → workspaces.current → logins.start → cookies.write。\n同版SharedWorker串行登录/刷新/退出；多处401过期复用一次刷新。前端不持久化JWT；Cookie不能认证业务，业务接口不依赖CSRF。\nRedis/数据库故障返回503，不按无权限或成功退出处理；网络结果未知不重试刷新/业务写入。旧Session不迁移，未采用tokenVersion。",
                  "wordWrap": true,
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "c2-uml-02501"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "showSequenceNumber": true,
              "sequenceNumbering": "custom",
              "showActivation": true,
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c2-uml-02500"
              }
            }
