                {
                  "_type": "UMLTextView",
                  "_id": "c2-uml-02834",
                  "font": "Microsoft YaHei;13;0",
                  "lineColor": "#30435b",
                  "fontColor": "#30435b",
                  "left": 90,
                  "top": 1069,
                  "width": 2582,
                  "height": 115,
                  "text": "提交与回调之间省略 Spring 事务模板内部的 TransactionSynchronizationUtils 分发。匿名回调实现定义于 Audit.record，不能画成 record 在提交后继续执行。\n事务未提交：afterCompletion 记录 FAILED / TRANSACTION_NOT_COMMITTED。业务异常被 record 捕获时立即 REJECTED 并重新抛出，不注册成功回调；运行时异常为 FAILED。\nfunc/oo 仅日志 logger/version 不同；提交前失败不能记录 COMMITTED。",
                  "wordWrap": true,
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "c2-uml-02784"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "showSequenceNumber": true,
              "sequenceNumbering": "custom",
              "showActivation": true,
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c2-uml-02783"
              }
            }
          ],
